ed queries"," - Define custom query methods with a SQL-like syntax",[278,323,325],{"id":324},"workflow","Workflow",[274,327,328],{},"The typical workflow for working with Kinotic persistence is:",[330,331,332,341,351],"ol",{},[286,333,334,337,338],{},[289,335,336],{},"Define your entity"," - Create a TypeScript class with decorators from ",[300,339,340],{},"@kinotic-ai\u002Fpersistence",[286,342,343,346,347,350],{},[289,344,345],{},"Sync to server"," - Run ",[300,348,349],{},"kinotic sync"," to push your entity definitions to the Kinotic server and generate typed service classes",[286,352,353,356],{},[289,354,355],{},"Use in your app"," - Import and use the generated services to perform data operations",[278,358,360],{"id":359},"packages","Packages",[274,362,363],{},"Two packages work together to provide the persistence layer:",[283,365,366,386],{},[286,367,368,372,373,376,377,376,380,376,383,385],{},[289,369,370],{},[300,371,340],{}," - Provides entity decorators (",[300,374,375],{},"@Entity",", ",[300,378,379],{},"@AutoGeneratedId",[300,381,382],{},"@NotNull",[300,384,302],{},", etc.), entity service interfaces, and the persistence plugin",[286,387,388,393,394,397],{},[289,389,390],{},[300,391,392],{},"@kinotic-ai\u002Fcore"," - Provides the connection layer (",[300,395,396],{},"Kinotic.connect()","), pagination types, and core utilities shared across all Kinotic packages",{"title":399,"searchDepth":400,"depth":400,"links":401},"",2,[402,403,404],{"id":280,"depth":400,"text":281},{"id":324,"depth":400,"text":325},{"id":359,"depth":400,"text":360},"Kinotic's persistence layer provides declarative data management with automatic CRUD service generation from TypeScript entity definitions.","md",null,{},true,{"title":31,"description":405},"YiqwlYlwY-eFleEwL_qZl5ZdVkZUSw8QEVE9TFmItz0",[413,415],{"title":89,"path":90,"stem":91,"description":414,"children":-1},"Real-time data streaming between services and clients.",{"title":102,"path":103,"stem":104,"description":416,"children":-1},"How to define entities using TypeScript decorators for Kinotic's persistence layer.",1792930939073]